SUMMARY:BIG IDEAS Book Club — Monthly Meetup
DESCRIPTION:A monthly meetup for discussing significant ideas from philosop
 hy\, psychology\, economics\, politics\, sociology\, and science. Topics r
 ange from 'free will' to key thinkers like Carl Jung\, fostering intellect
 ual engagement.
