SUMMARY:Cartoon Violence: Takeshi Murata and Bunny Rogers (Exhibition)
DESCRIPTION:This exhibition features two 3D animations by Takeshi Murata an
 d Bunny Rogers\, critically grappling with coded\, gendered violence in Am
 erican cartoons\, offering an intellectually stimulating perspective on cu
 lture and human behavior.
